      "id": "alls-well-that-ends-well/sceneIII_2.6/p@110271",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "BERTRAM.\nThat’s all the fault. I spoke with her but once,\nAnd found her wondrous cold, but I sent to her\nBy this same coxcomb that we have i’ the wind\nTokens and letters which she did re-send,\nAnd this is all I have done. She’s a fair creature;\nWill you go see her?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
